        <para>Specifies that the sequence shall consist of hexadecimal numbering.</para>
        <para>Example: 1, 2, 3, … , 9, A, B</para>
      </summary>
    </member>
    <member name="F:DevExpress.XtraRichEdit.API.Native.NumberingFormat.HindiConsonants">
