        <para>Example: 1st, 2nd, 3rd.</para>
        <para>The following languages are currently supported: English, French, German, Italian, Russian, Swedish and Turkish .</para>
      </summary>
    </member>
    <member name="F:DevExpress.XtraRichEdit.API.Native.NumberingFormat.OrdinalText">
