      <returns>A <see cref="T:DevExpress.XtraRichEdit.API.Native.DocumentRange"/> object representing the <see cref="P:DevExpress.XtraRichEdit.API.Native.DocumentRange.Start"/> and <see cref="P:DevExpress.XtraRichEdit.API.Native.DocumentRange.End"/> positions of the inserted text.</returns>
